/// annotation, never a parent class and never a hierarchy: a concept sits in
/// exactly one layer, and nothing is inherited along it.
///
/// This is the one layer vocabulary. The ontology declaration layer writes
/// these display strings, and the cortext contract's CWMLayer mirrors this
/// enum member for member, so no consumer translates between two sets.
